  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "A doctor named Ahmed Foratu, speaking about events in Varginha, Brazil, in 1996, when people say a strange creature was captured and a soldier who handled it fell ill and died, criticizes the commander of the local military police barracks. He says that a medical complication there deserved investigation, but that the commander pursued a fellow doctor who worked at the barracks with what he calls a witch hunt. According to Foratu, that doctor spent years having to explain himself to the courts, which he presents as a sign of how hard the authorities pressed anyone close to the case."
}
